=== (x)-square roots: positive real solutions of x(x)x = y (exact) ===
  ordinary a*b     sqrt(2) -> [sqrt(2)]   sqrt(4) -> [2]
  a+b              sqrt(2) -> [1]   sqrt(4) -> [2]
  2ab              sqrt(2) -> [1]   sqrt(4) -> [sqrt(2)]
  ab+1             sqrt(2) -> [1]   sqrt(4) -> [sqrt(3)]
  ab+a             sqrt(2) -> [1]   sqrt(4) -> [-1/2 + sqrt(17)/2]
  ab+min(a,b)      sqrt(2) -> [1]   sqrt(4) -> [-1/2 + sqrt(17)/2]
  2b (left-only)   sqrt(2) -> [1]   sqrt(4) -> [2]
  Howard (RS 2015) requires sqrt(4) = 2 and sqrt(2) = 1.
